==Battleground==
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hackey]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you play defensively and try to hold the ground from the beginning, you'll have to fight four dangerous enemies at once, so it's best to avoid that. Rather, focus on luring Razorback away from the others and killing him first, then Professor A. from close range, as by then your red tankers could take it from there due to Tackey and Hackey's blindspots preventing them from hitting your tanks. Thus, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] is one of the most effective units due to their high effective HP as well as their ability to Weaken, which allows [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] to hit Professor A. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] is a very good candidate for killing Razorback quickly, but [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] will suffice in {{4c}}.

